      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll aim for a balance between clarity and warmth. Here are three options for the error message:\n\n1. \"Sorry, it looks like you don't have enough funds to complete this transfer. Please try again with a different amount or consider a payment plan. You're getting closer to reaching your goal, and we're here to help.\"\n2. \"We're here to support you. Unfortunately, the transfer you initiated exceeds your current balance. Please review your account and try again with a smaller amount. We'll be happy to assist you in getting back on track.\"\n3. \"It seems like there's a bit of a gap between your current balance and the transfer amount. Don't worry, we're here to help you bridge that gap. Please try again with a smaller amount or explore other options with us.\"\n\nI've aimed to maintain a calm and helpful tone while still conveying the necessary information. The positivity score from the automated sentiment tool will help guide me to adjust the language if needed.",
